From e9499402643cfa6b44222898ad34c1a69da5a884 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Simone Rota <simone.rota16@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 14:06:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test: add the applications of the FLC 2026/27 project

Four small, self-checking applications: AES-128 (FIPS-197 known-answer
test, CBC encryption and decryption), an iterative radix-2 FFT, Huffman
compression and decompression, and the closed-loop PID speed control of a
DC motor. They are deterministic, print a summary of their results and end
with SUCCESS or FAIL; the fault handlers report the detections on stderr.

All the 55 combinations of data protection and control-flow checking pass
(220/220).
